# A static ability that names no player applies the same whoever controls its source (CR 613.1b changes only who
# controls it; "Nonbasic lands are Mountains" asks nothing of control). Bot2's Magus of the Moon makes both players'
# Mutavaults Mountains (CR 305.7, layer 4). Bot1 takes the Magus with Mind Control: both Mutavaults are still Mountains,
# with no other land type, and Bot1's taps for {R} towards that very Mind Control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mutavault
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Island
Mind Control
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mutavault
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Magus of the Moon
Plains x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mutavault.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mutavault.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mutavault.Activate(Ability: {C})
Bot2.Hand.Magus of the Moon.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault.Subtypes = Mountain
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {U}{U}{B}{R}{R}
Bot1.Hand.Mind Control.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Magus of the Moon)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mutavault; Mox Sapphire; Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Island; Mind Control; Magus of the Moon
Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault.Subtypes = Mountain
Bot2.Battlefield = Mutavault; Mox Ruby; Mox Jet
Bot2.Battlefield.Mutavault.Subtypes = Mountain
